--- struct copies, class aliases ---
struct  p1.x: 1  p2.x: 99
class   n1: changed  n2: changed
--- passed by value ---
returned: 105  caller's x is still: 5
--- what a copy copies ---
struct field a.start.x: 0   (b's change did not reach it)
array  field a.tags:   [ 'red', 'blue' ]   (b's push DID reach it -- a reference is shared)
--- collections hold copies ---
saved[0].x: 0  origin.x: 42
after the loop: 1 2
--- a pure operator ---
v1 + v2 = 11 22    (v1 is untouched: 1 2 )
